  "description": "Is your portfolio in trouble?",
  "body_html": "<p>What do you do when the greatest trader of all time, who would absolutely mop the floor with Warren Buffett, is shorting the stock market?</p><p>You ignore them. </p><p>Watch the video, and I explain why I am ignoring Mark Minervini, 2- Time U.S. Investing champion. If you like the video, give it a ❤️ and a re-stack please, this is the only way we beat out the AI slop here on Substack. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4>Some Quick Notes for all you investors today:</h4><ol><li><p>Are you selling today? Cutting or trimming any positions?</p></li><li><p>When will the market carnage end? </p></li><li><p>Which stocks will come back with the most gains?</p></li></ol><h4>Should We Sell, or Trim, or Wait?</h4><p>Ultimately, you do what you want. At the end of the day, I am a guy on the internet that does not have to sleep with your portfolio decisions. If you are a short or mid term investor, as in, trading just a few days or few weeks…you probably should have cut or trim around June 5th, this is where price action is below the 200 day moving average…a no-go zone per my mid term strategy. </p><p>Also, anytime the VIX is above 21, with market trend down, I do not buy anything. Period. DO NOTHING. The VIX has tapped 21 twice. We do not want to throw more money at a bonfire that may turn into a dumpster fire. </p><p>I stressed heavily in <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/work-less-make-more\">January that I am long term trading</a>. I shared position sizing and stop management…which is different than short and mid term. You simply have to to ride more waves, up and down, over time. Does that mean we turn a blind eye? No, not at all…but a -5% or -10% swing, for a stock that normally swings +/-50% while still being in a bull trend, is not going to rattle me. We rode through February and March, horrible months, and before the recent drop, 12 of the 13 positions were profitable. Right now we are 9 of 13 positions still profitable, with 6 over 10% or 20% profit at least.<strong> I am continuing to hold</strong> current positions, including the silver mining stock I know some of you are rattled about that I saw you all chatting about last night. </p><p>Could we cut it later? Possibly. Could we take a loss on a position? Also possible. Could I end up being wrong about everything? Sure… its been a while, the market humbling me is well overdue. <strong>But today, 6/10…I do not see a reason to cut long term positions. </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png\" width=\"1368\" height=\"815\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:815,&quot;width&quot;:1368,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:182691,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/201448414?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GXXZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b91e200-61e7-454f-9909-0ef86f2fe562_1368x815.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Ignore Mark’s X posts. You do not know his strategy. Plus, his short was not that successful. Also, that monthly candle on the S&amp;P 500, hast not even formed a low. </figcaption></figure></div><h4>Wen Bull Market?!</h4><p>You’re in a bull market! Unfortunately, it is not strait up all the time, sadly. In fact, we are very far away from being anywhere close to a bear market lol. I say this respectfully…but some of you are in for a rude awakening when an actual bear market does come…2008 sucked. SUCKED. In 2022, the chat rooms become ghost towns (which is a signal in itself, so stick around, regardless what happens!). </p><p>I have no idea when the<em><strong> local trend</strong></em> will resume (or if it even will). No one has a crystal ball. But the key clues the local bull trend is going for a continuation: When you get a major reversal upwards (don’t try to time the bottom) and the VIX continues trending below 21. <strong>Until then, sit on your hands, and relax</strong>. I think this pullback will be brief, personally. But that is a theory…wait for price action corroboration. NFA. </p><p>As always, I’ll give you a heads up as I always do… <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/publish/posts/detail/193622355?referrer=%2Fpublish%2Fposts%2Fpublished\">April 8<sup>th</sup> when I said the local Bull Trend</a> was back and <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/welcome-to-the-official-bull-market?r=4z8lgl\">June 10<sup>th</sup> when I declared the macro-bull market is back</a>… a macro trend we are still in. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uGeK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1c405395-7015-4f1d-9053-8d743b476bc9_1372x822.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uGeK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1c405395-7015-4f1d-9053-8d743b476bc9_1372x822.png 424w, https://subst