-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">I'm not perfect. I do not time tops, or bottoms. But I am pretty decent at identifying when trend has shifted, giving an opportunity to get into a winning position. </figcaption></figure></div><h4>Which Sector Is Showing The Most Promise For A Strong Return?</h4><p>Finance. </p><p>I’ve beat my drum endlessly about this over the year…and I will keep on beating the drum. No one is talking about Finance, particularly regional banks. They simply have the best macro structures, with the most momentum. Additionally, while the S&amp;P 500 has been shitting itself, the <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a></strong></em><strong> </strong>(a basket of stocks, not an actual ETF)…has been yet again dominating the indexes (image below). The S&amp;P 500 did overtake the ETF for a short period of time…but the ETF is now leading by ~4% the last month. This ETF is heavy with regional banks. Those stocks are still 100% relevant, and if you are looking for a long term, relaxed approach, I recommend checking out that article. As always, questions are welcome in the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/62da8ba2-2ee4-4ada-a814-5684bf31f23a\">Main Chat</a></strong>, where I am available during market hours. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ALbO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ALbO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ALbO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ALbO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ALbO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ALbO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png\" width=\"877\" height=\"723\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:723,&quot;width&quot;:877,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:72541,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/201448414?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4412e872-8885-4579-9e7a-282f520a6e8b_877x723.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" cl